# Safety snapshots of PersonalBrandingAgent's two stores (state_db/, the
# authoritative local publication history, and chroma_db/, the knowledge
# base). A snapshot is large, machine-specific, and a copy of state that
# only the machine that took it can interpret — so it is not repository
# content. Kept on disk deliberately, as the restore path for a purge.
Build_RAG_Applications_Get_Started/PersonalBrandingAgent-backups/
